Runtime dependencies
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pages is built with Go modules that are NOT vendored into this repository;
they are fetched by the Go toolchain (pinned by go.sum) and compiled into the
binary, and each carries its own licence. See go.mod for the declared set and
`go list -m all` / the module cache for the full list and texts. The set
includes github.com/jackc/pgx/v5 (MIT), github.com/santhosh-tekuri/jsonschema/v6
(Apache-2.0), github.com/tdewolff/parse/v2 (MIT) and golang.org/x/{crypto,net,
sync,text} (BSD-3-Clause). The npm packages in package.json (Playwright, axe)
are test tooling only and are not distributed with Pages.
